# Allowlist (#263): only what the image needs enters the build context. This is
# what keeps .env files, the corpus, backups, logs and venvs out of images.
**
!app/
!app/**
!scripts/
!scripts/**
!requirements.lock

# Never, even inside the allowed directories.
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/*.db
**/*.db-wal
**/*.db-shm
**/*.sqlite*
**/*.log
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.age
**/*.key
**/*.pem
